        "text": {
            "description_html": "<B>PDQ SX Series Grade 1 Commercial Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPDQ's Commercial Knobs are economically priced commercial door knob available in a wide selection of functions and finishes. The large ball style knob is easy to grab and looks great.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for PDQ SX Commercial Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Grade 1 lock</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prop: Fits standard 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/4\" or  2-3/8\".</li>\r\n<li>Case: Steel, yellow chromate plate.</li>\r\n<li>Front: 2-1/4\" X 1\" Stainless steel.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" X 1-1/4\" (Standard ASA). Stainless steel.</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" throw. Adjustable front for flat or beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: Stainless Steel Ball Knob</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyways: Schlage \"C\" Standard.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin cylinder keyed to 5-pins.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> for PDQ SX Commercial Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entrance (ANSI FF109)</b>: Outside knob locked by push/turn button inside. When outside knob is locked by push button inside - key from outside or rotating inside knob unlocks outside knob. When outside knob is locked by pushing and turning the button inside - key from outside or rotating inside knob retracts the latch but does not unlock outside knob.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
